comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T15:40:46.675Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check at creation (2026-11-06): pm search \"renderer output budget\" returned pm-5t33or (open, the declared-budget feature, now this item's parent), pm-prsvjh (closed, intent budget binding), pm-odw3j8 (closed, rendered relationship budgets), pm-gh1552 (closed, SDK compact JSON accounting), pm-t2t709 (closed, dependency budget measured on another representation) and pm-gd6vnn (open, observation contract). None covers a scoped registerRenderer replacement escaping the final-byte budget with a receipt measuring the native payload. The GitHub dedupe in the issue (#560, #96, #1552, #1662) reaches the same conclusion."
